WEBVTT

00:00:10.919 --> 00:00:12.449
Pull yourself together.

00:00:14.839 --> 00:00:17.989
Do you want to die on your first day?

00:00:18.089 --> 00:00:19.280
Do it now.

00:00:19.379 --> 00:00:21.109
Get crushed!

00:00:40.170 --> 00:00:41.990
You must live on.

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.530
What is going on here?

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:58.530
Do not let go of the RED Strings.

00:01:06.129 --> 00:01:07.280
Good morning.

00:01:07.879 --> 00:01:08.989
Good morning.

00:01:09.090 --> 00:01:11.489
The weather is great today.

00:01:11.590 --> 00:01:13.359
We have no mission this morning.

00:01:13.459 --> 00:01:16.739
Would you go out with me?
There's a place I want to visit.

00:01:19.670 --> 00:01:21.239
Baki!

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:39.780
SCARLET NEXUS

00:02:52.419 --> 00:02:54.030
SCARLET GUARDIANS

00:02:54.129 --> 00:02:56.280
Up next, we have Other attack forecast
for each province.

00:02:56.919 --> 00:02:59.240
The probability for Suoh Capital is 10%.

00:02:59.340 --> 00:03:01.699
For Seiran, it's 15%.

00:03:01.800 --> 00:03:04.650
The probability for Togetsu is 12%.

00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:07.240
"OTHERS TODAY"
The Extinction Belt is at the stratosphere.

00:03:07.340 --> 00:03:10.199
There is currently no impact on the surface.

00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:11.949
There is a higher chance of it
approaching certain areas in the afternoon.

00:03:12.050 --> 00:03:16.150
-I think the person who saved me was Kasane.
-Please stay cautious at all times.

00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:17.819
How is that possible?

00:03:17.919 --> 00:03:22.780
But members of OSF might have stunted growth.

00:03:22.879 --> 00:03:26.740
You have a point.
Appearances can be deceptive in OSF.

00:03:27.500 --> 00:03:30.610
2nd Lieutenant Arashi Spring
is the elder sister.

00:03:30.710 --> 00:03:35.199
Major General Fubuki is
the younger brother instead.

00:03:35.300 --> 00:03:37.650
The age and the appearances
have no direct relations.

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:39.780
So there is basically no need
for honorific titles.

00:03:39.879 --> 00:03:43.240
Ignore the ranks and titles,
what matters is true strength.

00:03:43.340 --> 00:03:45.030
Captain Seto said so himself.

00:03:45.919 --> 00:03:49.949
But Kasane and Naomi are both
amateurs just like us.

00:03:50.050 --> 00:03:51.949
They are only 16 years old.

00:03:52.050 --> 00:03:55.199
Even though Naomi is the elder sister,

00:03:55.300 --> 00:03:57.819
I'm not going to change my mind.

00:04:04.250 --> 00:04:06.030
I'm sorry to take up your time.

00:04:06.129 --> 00:04:10.740
If I let you go out alone,
you might attract creeps.

00:04:14.050 --> 00:04:17.449
All of us have powers.

00:04:17.550 --> 00:04:18.899
Thanks to our powers,

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:20.319
we cannot only access psynet

00:04:20.420 --> 00:04:23.029
but also use it for many things

00:04:23.129 --> 00:04:24.399
such as shopping.

00:04:25.250 --> 00:04:25.899
PAYMENT COMPLETED

00:04:26.209 --> 00:04:31.110
We can search for information
and send messages.

00:04:31.209 --> 00:04:35.949
Some of us have power,

00:04:36.050 --> 00:04:38.529
they are the OSF.

00:04:38.629 --> 00:04:42.529
Scarlet Guardians!

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:48.819
Yakumo Sumeragi.

00:04:48.920 --> 00:04:52.149
He saved mankind from total annihilation
with the Spring of Extinction.

00:04:52.250 --> 00:04:55.029
He is the founding father of New Himuka.

00:04:55.129 --> 00:04:56.740
A great man indeed.

00:04:56.839 --> 00:04:59.610
Your ancestor's grave is now
a tourism destination.

00:04:59.709 --> 00:05:01.569
He was born over 2000 years ago.

00:05:01.670 --> 00:05:03.319
So I don't feel any relation in particular.

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:04.949
There it is.

00:05:09.800 --> 00:05:12.740
BAKI TALISMAN

00:05:12.839 --> 00:05:15.490
An omikuji event in collaboration with Baki.

00:05:15.589 --> 00:05:17.990
Even the founding father is fashionable.

00:05:18.089 --> 00:05:19.949
Yuito, Nagi.

00:05:23.420 --> 00:05:25.899
Naomi and Kasane!

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:27.899
Are you here for the omikuji too?

00:05:28.000 --> 00:05:29.529
I'm here with Yuito.

00:05:29.629 --> 00:05:32.569
I ask Kasane to come with me.

00:05:32.670 --> 00:05:35.449
Yuito, do you like Baki too?

00:05:36.839 --> 00:05:38.610
-Well...
-Now that we are here,

00:05:38.709 --> 00:05:40.740
let's have some tea after this.

00:05:40.839 --> 00:05:42.990
There is still some time before
our mission this afternoon.

00:05:43.089 --> 00:05:44.779
Sister, beware of this man.

00:05:44.879 --> 00:05:47.199
I knew I should have come with you.

00:05:47.300 --> 00:05:49.740
-Did I do something wrong?
-Kasane...

00:05:51.420 --> 00:05:53.149
What is it?

00:05:53.250 --> 00:05:57.949
Kasane, Naomi, do you have a sister
that is much older than you?

00:05:58.050 --> 00:06:01.399
Kasane is my only sibling.

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:04.199
Do you have any relatives
who joined OSF in the past?

00:06:04.300 --> 00:06:06.399
No. Why do you ask?

00:06:06.500 --> 00:06:08.110
Let's draw the omikuji now.

00:06:08.209 --> 00:06:10.699
Then we'll have some tea together!

00:06:25.550 --> 00:06:28.899
"GREAT DISASTER"

00:06:29.459 --> 00:06:31.240
Sister, what did you get?

00:06:32.379 --> 00:06:34.240
Great prosperity.

00:06:34.339 --> 00:06:37.319
Everyone got the worst omikuji ever
except for Naomi.

00:06:37.420 --> 00:06:39.529
At least not all of us will get bad luck.

00:06:39.629 --> 00:06:43.699
But we have an OSF mission afterward.

00:06:43.800 --> 00:06:45.699
This is a bad omen.

00:06:45.800 --> 00:06:47.490
It's such a buzzkill.

00:06:53.129 --> 00:06:54.860
Don't throw it away, Nagi.

00:06:55.750 --> 00:06:58.569
Yuito!

00:06:58.670 --> 00:07:00.199
-Give it to me.
-Sorry!

00:07:00.300 --> 00:07:02.949
Yuito and Nagi, give me yours.

00:07:06.750 --> 00:07:08.149
Tie it like this.

00:07:09.129 --> 00:07:12.819
This should turn your bad luck
into lesser good luck.

00:07:16.000 --> 00:07:18.779
Let's give it our best from now on.

00:07:20.959 --> 00:07:24.110
You are so gentle and kind, Naomi!

00:07:24.209 --> 00:07:27.069
Your kindness saved us all!

00:07:27.170 --> 00:07:30.740
You saved me too! This is great!

00:07:32.709 --> 00:07:34.949
The Seiran front?

00:07:35.050 --> 00:07:36.319
Where is it this time?

00:07:36.420 --> 00:07:39.569
It's an abandoned underground railway line,
it's near the Suoh Nine.

00:07:41.170 --> 00:07:42.360
Just as we mentioned before,

00:07:42.459 --> 00:07:45.449
they are going in to investigate
the Other activity.

00:07:45.550 --> 00:07:50.029
They refuse to heed our advice
despite the objection.

00:07:50.129 --> 00:07:52.029
Send in backups.

00:07:52.129 --> 00:07:53.699
Yes. There's another report

00:07:53.800 --> 00:07:56.399
we have yet to verify.

00:07:56.500 --> 00:07:58.899
There are some suspicious activities in Togetsu.

00:08:00.209 --> 00:08:02.740
The Moon is stirring up troubles again.

00:08:02.839 --> 00:08:05.449
I will report after the investigation
has been completed.

00:08:05.550 --> 00:08:07.360
I'll leave it to you.

00:08:07.459 --> 00:08:08.490
Minister.

00:08:08.589 --> 00:08:09.899
No, Kaito.

00:08:10.000 --> 00:08:10.699
Yes.

00:08:10.800 --> 00:08:13.490
How is Yuito doing?

00:08:13.589 --> 00:08:16.819
I saw the report of him defeating an Other.

00:08:16.920 --> 00:08:19.990
I didn't get a chance to talk to him
after he joined the army.

00:08:20.089 --> 00:08:25.529
I know he is my brother, but I can't give him
any special treatments.

00:08:25.629 --> 00:08:28.990
I see. You have a point.

00:08:29.089 --> 00:08:31.029
That's all for the report today.

00:08:31.129 --> 00:08:32.570
I should leave now.

00:08:42.299 --> 00:08:45.029
The Seirans are on the move again.

00:08:45.129 --> 00:08:47.110
Let them be.

00:09:01.710 --> 00:09:03.570
What did I...

00:09:03.669 --> 00:09:05.279
What's wrong, Yuito?

00:09:06.379 --> 00:09:07.899
It's nothing.

00:09:09.669 --> 00:09:12.700
Everyone is here.

00:09:12.799 --> 00:09:16.110
The joint beginner training of
Seto Platoon and Kyoka Platoon

00:09:16.210 --> 00:09:17.779
is about to begin.

00:09:17.879 --> 00:09:19.360
A joint training?

00:09:19.460 --> 00:09:20.820
The rule is simple.

00:09:20.919 --> 00:09:24.149
It's a 5v5 simulation battle
between Seto Platoon and Kyoka Platoon.

00:09:24.250 --> 00:09:28.860
The first team to secure
the flag in the middle wins.

00:09:34.710 --> 00:09:36.820
There are only four in Kyoka Platoon.

00:09:42.419 --> 00:09:43.610
Arashi!

00:09:43.710 --> 00:09:48.240
Arashi, shutting down.

00:09:49.840 --> 00:09:50.860
Don't fall asleep!

00:09:50.960 --> 00:09:54.779
She seems different from the TV.

00:09:55.629 --> 00:09:57.990
When we saw her online and on the news...

00:09:58.090 --> 00:10:00.820
I will give it my best too!

00:10:00.919 --> 00:10:02.990
That's when she's at work.

00:10:03.090 --> 00:10:05.779
What we see here is her usual self.

00:10:05.879 --> 00:10:08.990
People in the OSF call her Lazy Arashi.

00:10:09.090 --> 00:10:12.320
Fine, let's get it over with.

00:10:12.419 --> 00:10:14.700
Okay, everyone.

00:10:16.460 --> 00:10:17.950
Let's do our best.

00:10:18.049 --> 00:10:19.200
Okay.

00:10:25.669 --> 00:10:27.779
It's done, Kasane.

00:10:34.799 --> 00:10:37.990
This is the proof of our bond as sisters.

00:10:45.090 --> 00:10:47.200
-Sister.
What is it?

00:10:47.299 --> 00:10:50.700
Are you concerned about Yuito?

00:10:50.799 --> 00:10:52.950
Kasane, what made you say that?

00:10:57.340 --> 00:10:59.399
I'm not particularly concerned...

00:11:00.549 --> 00:11:04.149
I just find him a nice person.

00:11:04.250 --> 00:11:05.820
Understood.

00:11:05.919 --> 00:11:08.360
Whether he is qualified to be with you,

00:11:08.460 --> 00:11:11.029
I will find it out.

00:11:11.129 --> 00:11:12.240
Kasane!

00:11:15.799 --> 00:11:19.399
"MAJOR SHIDEN RITTER, POWER: ELECTROKINESIS"
Young Master of the Sumeragi family.

00:11:19.960 --> 00:11:21.110
"CAPTAIN GEMMA GARRISON"
He defeated an Other

00:11:21.210 --> 00:11:22.570
"POWER: SCLEROKINESIS"
on his first day.

00:11:22.669 --> 00:11:25.279
Don't let your guard down around him, Shiden.

00:11:27.169 --> 00:11:28.360
All right.

00:11:29.629 --> 00:11:31.779
"HARUKA FRAZER, POWER: TELEPATHY"
It's about to start.

00:11:31.879 --> 00:11:33.240
Ready,

00:11:33.340 --> 00:11:34.320
go!

00:11:37.549 --> 00:11:38.740
Kasane!

00:11:38.840 --> 00:11:40.320
Watch out for the flame!

00:11:55.299 --> 00:11:56.700
It started.

00:11:57.340 --> 00:12:00.360
"MAJOR KYOKA EDEN, POWER: DUPLICATION"
Go for it, everyone!

00:12:03.590 --> 00:12:05.399
Naomi, sorry about that.

00:12:17.549 --> 00:12:20.149
It's the same trick as before.

00:12:20.250 --> 00:12:22.610
My power is clairvoyance.

00:12:22.710 --> 00:12:24.990
I can foresee the future in an instant.

00:12:33.210 --> 00:12:34.529
I'm too lazy to move.

00:12:34.629 --> 00:12:35.649
I see it.

00:12:49.169 --> 00:12:50.610
Not bad, Gemma.

00:12:50.710 --> 00:12:52.450
You could sense me.

00:12:52.549 --> 00:12:55.529
Don't pull any punches, bring it on!

00:13:05.049 --> 00:13:06.990
I must get the flag!

00:13:19.710 --> 00:13:22.070
Kasane, don't you remember the rules?

00:13:35.090 --> 00:13:36.610
FAILURE

00:13:36.710 --> 00:13:39.610
VICTORY

00:13:47.750 --> 00:13:49.200
Arashi!

00:13:49.299 --> 00:13:50.950
I'm exhausted.

00:13:51.049 --> 00:13:53.610
This should be enough for training.

00:13:55.299 --> 00:13:57.110
She is quite a handful.

00:13:58.049 --> 00:13:59.200
Well done.

00:13:59.299 --> 00:14:00.740
You did great too.

00:14:05.419 --> 00:14:07.200
You're not too shabby.

00:14:07.299 --> 00:14:09.899
I felt the same when we last fought together.

00:14:10.750 --> 00:14:11.740
I appreciate the compliment.

00:14:11.840 --> 00:14:15.110
But it takes more to earn my acknowledgment.

00:14:15.210 --> 00:14:17.820
Whether you deserve my sister or not,

00:14:17.919 --> 00:14:19.779
I'll keep observing.

00:14:19.879 --> 00:14:21.950
What do you mean about observing?

00:14:22.750 --> 00:14:24.740
Excuse me, I have a message.

00:14:26.500 --> 00:14:27.820
Father?

00:14:32.169 --> 00:14:34.320
Congratulations on making it into the force.

00:14:34.419 --> 00:14:38.200
I'm still against the idea of you joining OSF.

00:14:38.299 --> 00:14:40.899
But at least don't get yourself hurt.

00:14:41.000 --> 00:14:43.240
Since you're a member of OSF now,

00:14:43.340 --> 00:14:45.740
that means you can hold your own.

00:14:45.840 --> 00:14:46.950
I want to use this opportunity

00:14:47.049 --> 00:14:51.360
to talk to you about our family
and your late mother.

00:14:51.460 --> 00:14:55.740
We'll have dinner with Kaito another day.

00:14:55.840 --> 00:14:57.450
I'll contact you again.

00:15:03.669 --> 00:15:06.490
Kagero, your surprised me.

00:15:06.590 --> 00:15:08.529
What is it, Tsugumi?

00:15:08.629 --> 00:15:11.610
I thought you hated training.

00:15:11.710 --> 00:15:14.070
We don't have new members every day.

00:15:14.169 --> 00:15:16.450
Not to mention there are more girls
joining our platoon this year.

00:15:16.549 --> 00:15:19.029
I have to make sure they see
the awesome side of me.

00:15:26.000 --> 00:15:26.990
Deployment order.

00:15:27.090 --> 00:15:28.740
Other activities confirmed.

00:15:28.840 --> 00:15:32.529
The location is the abandoned railway line
of Suoh Nine.

00:15:32.629 --> 00:15:33.950
Seto Platoon and Kyoka Platoon,

00:15:34.049 --> 00:15:35.899
please deploy immediately.

00:15:39.799 --> 00:15:42.950
A lot of them fell from the Extinction Belt.

00:15:43.049 --> 00:15:45.200
The Others have got in through the air vents.

00:15:45.299 --> 00:15:49.610
Communication devices might be affected here.

00:15:49.710 --> 00:15:52.450
Relying solely on telepathy without brain talk

00:15:52.549 --> 00:15:55.899
will result in a one-way communication from me.

00:15:56.000 --> 00:15:59.700
Let's pray the comms will work fine.

00:15:59.799 --> 00:16:02.110
Seto Platoon, move out.

00:16:02.210 --> 00:16:03.950
Kyoka Platoon, move out.

00:16:33.960 --> 00:16:35.779
Hold on, Brother.

00:16:35.879 --> 00:16:37.990
What are you planning?

00:16:38.090 --> 00:16:40.399
What is it that you seek?

00:16:40.500 --> 00:16:43.450
The past and future of this country.

00:17:03.129 --> 00:17:04.200
They are here!

00:17:04.799 --> 00:17:05.779
Get ready!

00:17:12.170 --> 00:17:12.900
Scatter!

00:17:13.000 --> 00:17:14.150
Begin the attacks!

00:17:39.589 --> 00:17:43.069
Captain, the communication disruption caused
by the Extinction Belt is getting worse.

00:17:43.170 --> 00:17:45.529
At this rate...

00:17:45.630 --> 00:17:48.029
Understood. How is Kyoka Platoon doing?

00:17:48.130 --> 00:17:49.240
Wataru?

00:17:49.880 --> 00:17:52.240
Enemies from above, watch out!

00:17:52.339 --> 00:17:54.029
What was that? Haruka, repeat!

00:17:54.130 --> 00:17:55.319
They are attacking from above!

00:17:56.210 --> 00:17:57.109
Sister!

00:18:03.339 --> 00:18:04.109
Captain Kyoka.

00:18:04.210 --> 00:18:05.779
Arashi, Shiden!

00:18:21.299 --> 00:18:23.109
Yuito, Nagi.

00:18:23.210 --> 00:18:24.490
It's Kasane and Naomi.

00:18:24.589 --> 00:18:27.029
Kasane, Naomi, are you all right?

00:18:27.130 --> 00:18:28.900
Tsugumi, where are Captain Seto and the rest?

00:18:29.000 --> 00:18:30.740
We lost communication with them.

00:18:30.839 --> 00:18:32.490
But I know they will be fine.

00:18:32.589 --> 00:18:33.990
Where are Kyoka and the rest?

00:18:34.089 --> 00:18:37.609
They can handle this level of enemies with ease.

00:18:37.710 --> 00:18:38.700
They are here!

00:18:40.000 --> 00:18:41.529
Naomi, watch out!

00:18:41.630 --> 00:18:42.900
-Nagi!
-Sister!

00:18:46.210 --> 00:18:47.779
Gemma, Tsugumi!

00:19:27.460 --> 00:19:28.900
Is everyone all right?

00:19:31.710 --> 00:19:34.529
We are all right. What about the other two?

00:19:34.630 --> 00:19:36.450
Where are Nagi and Naomi?

00:19:36.549 --> 00:19:38.529
Sister!

00:19:41.170 --> 00:19:43.529
I found them. They are in here.

00:19:43.630 --> 00:19:45.490
Yuito, are you still there?

00:19:45.589 --> 00:19:47.740
Nagi, where are you now?

00:19:47.839 --> 00:19:49.700
We're on the other side of these boulders.

00:19:49.799 --> 00:19:51.319
Naomi is with me.

00:19:55.750 --> 00:19:56.950
Nagi.

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:01.069
What is it, Nagi?

00:20:01.170 --> 00:20:02.319
The enemies are here!

00:20:02.420 --> 00:20:03.490
Sister!

00:20:03.589 --> 00:20:06.200
This is bad. They are surrounded by Others.

00:20:16.420 --> 00:20:18.150
Connect the SAS cable.

00:20:18.589 --> 00:20:19.400
Understood.

00:20:19.500 --> 00:20:20.359
Let's give it a shot.

00:20:34.960 --> 00:20:36.029
Sister!

00:20:42.799 --> 00:20:44.490
Nagi, are you all right?

00:20:44.589 --> 00:20:46.400
Sorry about that...

00:20:46.500 --> 00:20:47.319
Sister!

00:20:47.420 --> 00:20:49.359
I'm all right, Kasane.

00:20:59.049 --> 00:21:00.069
No!

00:21:17.880 --> 00:21:19.029
Kasane?

00:21:19.130 --> 00:21:21.319
Kasane!

00:21:23.380 --> 00:21:25.740
Sister...

00:21:25.839 --> 00:21:27.569
I'm glad you're safe.

00:21:39.339 --> 00:21:40.569
Sister?

00:21:41.960 --> 00:21:44.029
What's wrong? Sister!

00:21:55.130 --> 00:21:57.279
Sister?

00:22:05.049 --> 00:22:06.400
Let's move, Karen.
